  "title": "INSTALL EXTENSION HOUSING",
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "30. INSTALL EXTENSION HOUSING"
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 1,
      "description": "Extension housing installation showing intermediate plate and gasket placement",
      "labels": [
        "WM0063"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 4,
        "left": 2,
        "width": 45,
        "height": 19
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": true,
      "items": [
        "(a) Place a new gasket in position on the intermediate plate.",
        "(b) Insert shift and select lever into the extension housing."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 2,
      "description": "Shift and select lever connection to shift fork shaft",
      "labels": [
        "WM0032"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 23,
        "left": 2,
        "width": 45,
        "height": 19
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(c) Connect the shift and select lever to the shift fork shaft."
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 3,
      "description": "Installation of shift lever housing to shift and select lever shaft push in extension housing",
      "labels": [
        "WM0031"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 42,
        "left": 2,
        "width": 45,
        "height": 19
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(d) Install shift lever housing to shift and select lever shaft push in the extension housing."
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 4,
      "description": "Bolt installation and torquing on extension housing assembly",
      "labels": [
        "WM0255"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 61,
        "left": 2,
        "width": 45,
        "height": 19
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(e) Install and torque the bolt."
    },
    {
      "type": "torque_spec",
      "component": "Bolt",
      "value": "400 kg-cm (29 ft-lb, 39 N·m)"
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 5,
      "description": "Extension housing bolts installation",
      "labels": [
        "WM0172"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 80,
